# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Medhat's Portfolio — Environment Variables
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
#  Copy this file to .env and fill in your values.
#  NEVER commit .env to git.
#
#  NOTE: every VITE_* value is inlined into the public JavaScript bundle at build time,
#  so anyone can read it from the deployed site. These are not secrets — they identify
#  your account to a third-party API, nothing more. The protections that matter are the
#  provider-side ones (Gemini API key restrictions, Web3Forms' domain allow-list).
#
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  AI AGENT — Powered by Google Gemini (100% FREE)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
#  1. Go to: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#  2. Click "Create API key" (free, no credit card needed)
#  3. Copy the key and paste it below
#
#  Free tier limits: 15 requests/min · 1,500 requests/day · 1M tokens/day
#  That's more than enough for a portfolio!
#
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=your-gemini-api-key-here

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  CONTACT FORM — Powered by Web3Forms (100% FREE, no backend)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
#  1. Go to: https://web3forms.com
#  2. Enter YOUR email address to receive an Access Key (instant, no signup)
#  3. Copy the key and paste it below
#  4. Every contact-form submission is delivered straight to that inbox
#
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=your-web3forms-access-key-here
